<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Interview Invitation - {{companyName}}</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f7f8fa;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 40px 16px;
            -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
        }
        .email-wrapper {
            max-width: 560px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
            border: 1px solid #eaeef2;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .email-header {
            padding: 32px 40px 0 40px;
        }
        .company-logo {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.3px;
            color: #111111;
        }
        .email-body {
            padding: 32px 40px 40px 40px;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.65;
            margin: 0 0 20px 0;
            color: #4b5563;
        }
        p.greeting {
            color: #111111;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .location-card {
            background-color: #f9fafb;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #374151;
        }
        .location-card strong {
            color: #111111;
        }
        .btn-container {
            margin: 28px 0;
        }
        .btn {
            background-color: #111111;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 500;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .signature {
            margin-top: 32px;
            padding-top: 24px;
            border-top: 1px solid #f0f2f5;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #4b5563;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .signature strong {
            color: #111111;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-wrapper">
        <div class="email-header">
            <div class="company-logo">{{companyName}}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="email-body">
            <p class="greeting">Hello {{candidateName}},</p>

            <p>We are excited to invite you to an in-person interview for the <strong>{{jobTitle}}</strong> position at <strong>{{companyName}}</strong>.</p>

            <div class="location-card">
                <strong>Location:</strong><br>
                {{companyName}} Office<br>
                {{officeAddress}}<br>
                <a href="{{mapLink}}" target="_blank" style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; display: inline-block; margin-top: 6px;">View on Google Maps &rarr;</a>
            </div>

            <p>We have multiple interview times available. Please click the link below to select a time that works best for you:</p>

            <div class="btn-container">
                <a href="{{scheduleLink}}" class="btn" target="_blank">Schedule Your Interview</a>
            </div>

            <p>We look forward to meeting you in person!</p>

            <div class="signature">
                Best regards,<br>
                <strong>{{senderName}}</strong><br>
                {{senderTitle}}, {{companyName}}
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>